Wi-Fi
-----
b43 / b43-next — GPL-2.0-only
  https://github.com/aleferri/b43-next
  commit ee7ed443dc8dde43bd2b2e9aea7d170ad5e92e1b
  AC-PHY patches from the OpenWrt b43-ac-phy branch.

Broadcom wireless firmware 6.30.163.46 (784.2), redistributed in the
linux-firmware package under Broadcom's firmware licence; squashed to core
revision 42 / AC by the b43-next package. The firmware is redistributable but
not open source.

Not included in the image
-------------------------
AdGuard Home — GPL-3.0 (https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdGuardHome)
